WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Leadership has three connected choices.

00:00:02.217 --> 00:00:05.760
Define the quality capability
the organization wants to build.

00:00:05.897 --> 00:00:08.880
Invest in the foundations
and people that make it usable.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:13.120
Expand where outcomes and controls
support a broader scope.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.200
The vision is that AI contributes
more work while the institution

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:21.120
becomes better at judging that work.
The presentation's examples provide

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:25.040
a way to discuss those choices;
local evidence determines the commitment.
